  "description": "Bonggoo Park makes a living as a male escort. Hoping to change his life, he seeks a new line of job and chances upon a classified ad about a male housekeeper. Bonggoo \"wins\" the relatively high-paying position with ease. Despite being a popular novelist, his employer Jinwoo Yang leaves the paparazzi with no photos. The many rumors are all there is about the mysterious writer.The first day of work as a male housekeeper... The first encounter with the infamous novelist Jinwoo Yang... Bonggoo's curiosity only grows when he sees the writer behind a mask.\n\n(Source: Netcomics)",
